    # ---- REFLECTION RE-ENTRY SEQUENCE (AURORA_COGNITIVE_PHYSICS.md §6–§8) ----
    # Mandatory: STATE → EXPRESSION → RE-ENTRY → RECONCILIATION → UNDERSTANDING
